{"page":530,"width":1515,"height":1994,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"제3장","words":[{"text":"제3장","x":1160,"y":209,"width":189,"height":86}]},{"text":"드니","words":[{"text":"드니","x":458,"y":401,"width":126,"height":47}]},{"text":"인덱人","words":[{"text":"인덱人","x":181,"y":401,"width":220,"height":79}]},{"text":"장 소개","words":[{"text":"장","x":186,"y":619,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"소개","x":226,"y":619,"width":51,"height":28}]},{"text":"SQL 튜닝의 가장 핵심은 I/O 효율회에 있다. I/O 효율화 튜닝을 위해서는 왜에서 설명할 옵티마이저 원리를","words":[{"text":"SQL","x":195,"y":700,"width":50,"height":27},{"text":"튜닝의","x":256,"y":697,"width":70,"height":27},{"text":"가장","x":338,"y":697,"width":48,"height":28},{"text":"핵심은","x":395,"y":697,"width":69,"height":27},{"text":"I/O","x":474,"y":699,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"효율회에","x":517,"y":696,"width":89,"height":27},{"text":"있다.","x":617,"y":695,"width":51,"height":28},{"text":"I/O","x":680,"y":698,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"효율화","x":723,"y":695,"width":71,"height":27},{"text":"튜닝을","x":803,"y":694,"width":69,"height":28},{"text":"위해서는","x":882,"y":694,"width":93,"height":28},{"text":"왜에서","x":984,"y":694,"width":81,"height":28},{"text":"설명할","x":1078,"y":695,"width":70,"height":27},{"text":"옵티마이저","x":1158,"y":694,"width":114,"height":28},{"text":"원리를","x":1285,"y":694,"width":70,"height":27}]},{"text":"바탕으로 인덱스 및 조인의 내부 수행원리를 이해하는 것이 필수적이다. 본 장은 그 중에서도 가장 핵심이라고","words":[{"text":"바탕으로","x":164,"y":740,"width":98,"height":28},{"text":"인덱스","x":274,"y":740,"width":72,"height":28},{"text":"및","x":358,"y":741,"width":21,"height":27},{"text":"조인의","x":391,"y":740,"width":68,"height":28},{"text":"내부","x":474,"y":741,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"수행원리를","x":528,"y":739,"width":113,"height":29},{"text":"이해하는","x":653,"y":739,"width":91,"height":28},{"text":"것이","x":755,"y":738,"width":43,"height":29},{"text":"필수적이다.","x":813,"y":738,"width":120,"height":29},{"text":"본","x":946,"y":738,"width":24,"height":28},{"text":"장은","x":981,"y":738,"width":47,"hei